### 2. Inscription
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "djibril@sndeals.sn",
  "password": "123456",
  "name": "Djibril",
  "phone": "+221 77 000 00 00",
  "location": "Dakar"
